/**
 * TimeEntry once carried a two-decimal display form of its hours, because a
 * Decimal bound to a dynamictext rendered as `2.50000000` and there was no way
 * to say otherwise. A `format` block on the content parameter says otherwise, so
 * the attribute is gone and the widgets format themselves.
 *
 * Dropped rather than left in place: an unused string that four microflows used
 * to maintain is a trap for whoever reads them next.
 */
ALTER ENTITY "TimeReg"."TimeEntry" DROP ATTRIBUTE IF EXISTS "HoursLabel";
/
